  "job_B1.4.22_20251001_193236": {
    "chunk_text": "god me asende to sona his engel, Se cyning \u00fea sona swi\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s f\u00e6gnode, and het up ateon ardlice danihel, and \u00fea in awurpan \u00fee hine Hi wurdan \u00fea gebrohte mid bearnum and wifum, and into \u00feam sea\u00f0e sona aworpene, and \u00fea leon hi \u00d0a sende se cyning sona \u00e6nne pistol geond ealle his leoda, and hi luflice grette, \u00feisum wordum He is lifigenda god, and ece on weorulde, and his rice ne bi\u00f0 toworpen on ecnysse. He is so\u00f0 alysend, and tacna wyrcend on heofonum and on eor\u00f0an, se \u00f0e heold danihel wi\u00f0 \u00fea re\u00fean Danihel leofode \u00fea swi\u00f0e leof \u00feam cyninge, o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t cyrus cyning to \u00feam cynedome feng, and danihel \u00dea w\u00e6s on babilone, \u00fe\u00e6re micclan byrig, \u00fe\u00e6ra h\u00e6\u00feenra god, se w\u00e6s gehaten bel, and hine man Se cyning hine wur\u00f0ode, and com \u00e6lce d\u00e6ge hine to gebiddanne to bel \u00feam gode; and danihel se \u00d0a axode se cyning on anum d\u00e6ge danihel, hwi nelt \u00feu \u00fee gebiddan to bele \u00feam gode? \u00dea andwerde danihel anr\u00e6dlice \u00feam cyninge, ic nelle wur\u00f0ian \u00fea geworhtan godas, ac ic gelyfe on \u00d0a andwyrde se cyning eft \u00feam witegan, ne \u00feinc\u00f0 \u00fee, la, danihel, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fees deorwyr\u00f0a bel sy lifiende \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 danihel, ne dwela \u00feu, cyning; \u00fees god is \u00e6ren wi\u00f0utan agoten, and l\u00e6men wi\u00f0innan, and ne \u00dea geswearc se cyning sona",
